CtIG2ajqanrvytQFDsBO_gwh-sLU" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">Nvidia</a> has spar=
ked a strong rally in Asia-Pacific stock markets today,</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Stocks have surged in Taiwan, South Korea,=
 Japan and Australia, as the AI trade lurches back into life.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The Taiwanese TW50 index has surged by 9.5=
%, away from the seven-month high touched yesterday. In Seoul, the Kospi in=
dex has jumped by 6.5%, led by chipmakers SK Hynix and Samsung Electronics.=
 And in Tokyo, the Nikkei has gained almost 4%.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">That followed a surge on Wall Street last =
night, where Nvidia=E2=80=99s shares rocketed by 31.5% =E2=80=93 adding aro=
und $950bn to the company=E2=80=99s value as Huang returned to the company=
=E2=80=99s HQ.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Huang=E2=80=99s return =E2=80=9Cremoves an=
 important source of uncertainty,=E2=80=9D said Charu Chanana, chief invest=
ment strategist at Saxo in Singapore, adding: =E2=80=9CHis return restores =
strategic continuity at Nvidia and reduces the immediate risk of disruption=
s to its supply chain and technology roadmap.=E2=80=9D</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">But while Wall Street recorded its best da=
y since April 2025 (when Donald Trump paused his Liberation Day tariffs), d=
oubts over the high valuations of AI companies, and questions over whether =
the industry will generate revenues to sustain their high spending on datac=
entres, remain.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">As does the political backlash against Hua=
ng=E2=80=99s return, and the role played by Donald Trump=E2=80=99s White Ho=
use in pressing Nvidia to take its former CEO back.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Democrat senator Elizabeth Warren has call=
ed Huang=E2=80=99s restoration =E2=80=9Creckless,=E2=80=9D and warned that =
the banking committee she will head next year will be digging into whether =
Nvidia has complied with export controls.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">She also said the Trump administration =E2=
=80=9Cneeds to explain to Congress what =E2=80=98input=E2=80=99 was given a=
nd by which senior officials in the United States government to support his=
 reinstatement.=E2=80=9D</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Republican lawmakers also roundly criticis=
ed the Nvidia board=E2=80=99s decision to reinstate its chief executive, Je=
nsen Huang, even after <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/=
ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHECOw8tKrjsP9EkGMKBaef6ks=
Vb1sG2mdBAv5I1p9NWhxLs2PV7cM0gKQJc7hfAa5yXpZbhJUfgDgV3uc6Ulff8RPhDNXby2nLdc=
0ZT6kWMR_i9JCZ7NQtYgKcKmbgS-a9hFhLB3aj1BHD4SNUcH7G4anL7D2Zs5crIrfqsIS06NnGp=
okXvKA-Xb4XFsZMt55Xc/4w0/PMmH1dVmRV2uMSwR1u7wcw/h31/h001.3NpWI24rd-DeBzTO6m=
FIBMOoWX_YKsS5rYrKzU-sJF8" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">Donald Trump</a> said =
he spoke =E2=80=9Cdirectly and indirectly=E2=80=9D with board members and =
=E2=80=9Cconvinced them=E2=80=9D to bring him back.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Pete Ricketts, a US senator from Nebraska,=
 <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.QvkQtXiSzSIN=
XrMyEJiuYlnp4voKyxJ9nHap_1AnxzZNTbJwmRvDeOT9Cm0dn8STTcvQIXHfKQTej9ZB-W0PrKB=
